  "status_raw": "\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 qsimeon/growlab \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502  growlab                                                                     \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2502       status  Paused  \u2014  Project is paused. Turn Project active on to        \u2502\n\u2502               resume.                                                        \u2502\n\u2502    objective  Minimize mean validation loss at a FIXED FLOP budget (4e14)    \u2502\n\u2502               by choosing the parameter growth trajectory N(t) -- the        \u2502\n\u2502               schedule of when and how the model grows during training.      \u2502\n\u2502               Edit SCHEDULE and START in grow/experiment.py. Lower           \u2502\n\u2502               OBJECTIVE is better.                                           \u2502\n\u2502  constraints  1) The budget is FLOPs, never wall-clock and never step count  \u2502\n\u2502               -- do not change FLOP_BUDGET. 2) Every trajectory must end at  \u2502\n\u2502               exactly 6L 8H 256D; experiment.py enforces this. 3) The        \u2502\n\u2502               objective must be the mean over >=3 seeds -- do not reduce     \u2502\n\u2502               SEEDS, single-seed results are noise at this scale. 4) Do not  \u2502\n\u2502               modify the evaluation, the data pipeline, or flops_per_token   \u2502\n\u2502               in grow/model.py. 5) The interesting knob is the SHAPE of      \u2502\n\u2502               N(t): when to grow, how much, width vs depth. Optimizing       \u2502\n\u2502               learning rate instead is off-objective.                        \u2502\n\u2502          run  uv run python grow/experiment.py                               \u2502\n\u2502         prep  uv sync && uv run python grow/data.py                          \u2502\n\u2502  description  Given compute C, choose the parameter trajectory N(t).         \u2502\n\u2502               Scaling laws fix N constant and never argued for it.           \u2502\n\u2502       source  \u2014                                                              \u2502\n\u2502          llm  anthropic/claude-opus-4-8  \u00b7  key AutoLab Key (platform)       \u2502\n\u2502        ideas  on                                                             \u2502\n\u2502        nodes  none \u2014 autolab serve --project qsimeon/growlab                 \u2502\n\u2502  experiments  0 queued  \u00b7  0 active  \u00b7  0 done                               \u2502\n\u2502         link  https://app.autolab.ai/projects/qsimeon/growlab                \u2502\n\u2502                                                                              \u2502\n\u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 https://app.autolab.ai \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256f\n\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 you're in \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502 